<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

<!-- About Hero -->
<div class="about-hero">
  <div class="overlay"></div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div>
    <h1>Our Story</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Story Section -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <span style="color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;">Since 1923</span>
        <h2>A Century of Culinary Excellence</h2>
        <p>La Maison Dorée was founded in the heart of Paris in 1923 by Chef Auguste Laurent, a passionate culinary artist who believed that dining should be an experience that engages all the senses. What began as a small family bistro on the Rue du Faubourg Saint-Honoré has grown into one of Paris's most beloved dining destinations.</p>
        <p>For four generations, the Laurent family has preserved the traditions and recipes that made La Maison Dorée famous. Our kitchen brings together the finest flavours from across Europe — from the rich stews of France to the delicate pastas of Italy, from the hearty schnitzels of Austria to the vibrant paellas of Spain.</p>
        <p>Every dish that leaves our kitchen is a testament to our commitment to quality, tradition, and the art of European gastronomy. We source only the finest seasonal ingredients, working with local farmers and artisanal producers who share our passion for excellence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?w=800&q=80" alt="Restaurant interior" onerror="this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?w=800&q=80'">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Values -->
<section class="section" style="background: var(--cream-dark);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <span class="subtitle">What We Stand For</span>
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
        <h4>Fresh &amp; Local</h4>
        <p>We source seasonal ingredients from local farmers and artisanal producers, ensuring every dish bursts with freshness and supports our community.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <i class="fas fa-fire"></i>
        <h4>Authentic Recipes</h4>
        <p>Our chefs preserve century-old European recipes, passed down through generations, while adding a modern touch to each creation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
        <h4>Hospitality</h4>
        <p>Every guest is family. We create a warm, welcoming atmosphere where memories are made over exquisite food and fine wine.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Chef Section -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid" style="direction: rtl;">
      <div class="about-image" style="direction: ltr;">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577219491135-ce391730fb2c?w=800&q=80" alt="Executive Chef" onerror="this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?w=800&q=80'">
      </div>
      <div class="about-text" style="direction: ltr;">
        <span style="color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;">Meet the Chef</span>
        <h2>Chef Marie Laurent</h2>
        <p>As the great-granddaughter of founder Auguste Laurent, Chef Marie Laurent continues the family legacy with passion and innovation. Trained at Le Cordon Bleu and having worked in Michelin-starred kitchens across Europe, she brings a unique blend of tradition and creativity to every plate.</p>
        <p>"Cooking is not just about feeding people — it's about creating moments of joy, connection, and memory. Every dish tells a story, and I want our guests to taste the love and history in every bite." — Chef Marie Laurent</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="section" style="background: var(--burgundy); text-align: center;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 16px;">Experience La Maison Dorée</h2>
    <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 32px;">Whether you're joining us in person or ordering online, we can't wait to share our passion for European cuisine with you.</p>
    <a href="/menu" class="btn btn-gold btn-lg"><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i> View Our Menu</a>
  </div>
</section>

